@node history
                    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
                                 History:
                    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

- v0.3          completely rewrote it after the old version was gone after
                a HD crash
- v0.4          added review with sorting
- v0.5          first public beta release
                Review improved with graph bars, access checking for
                delete/add
- v0.6          access checking for each topic
- v0.7          improved vote scanning: now topics are shown at login,
                topic menu  shown in two rows

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
                         v0.8 - released 08-Jan-94
grafical  output  improvements,  made  scan  routine look nicer, added save
progress  indicator,  searches  for  duplicate  items,  checks  now if item
already  exists,  removed  some  minor  bugs,  now  info  option  with long
description possibility, configurable callerslog option
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
v0.9 - released
again improved the design a bit and made it more compact, updated helpfile,
result download  option as ANSI file
---------------------------------------------------------------------------


All  of the WiLDTools are first released at DiXiE BBS and then at Mamba and
Crazy World.

If you want beta - test my tools @{"call me" link "contact"}.
@endnode

